:: Poppy Lake Gifts
<<effects>><<lakeeffects>><<run poppySchedule()>>
<<set _gift to setup.foodstuff[$gift].name + (setup.foodstuff[$gift].food.handheld_gift ? " gift" : "")>><<wearProp _gift>>
<<if T.poppyStatus and T.poppyStatus.includes("LowPatience")>>
	Poppy glances at the food in your hands, then pointedly looks away.
	<br><br>
	"I'm not in the mood for gifts right now," <<he>> says flatly.
	<<poppyOpiumPulse>><<handheldon>>
	<<poppyLakeReturn>>
<<else>>
	"I've made you a gift," you say. "I hope you like it."
	<br><br>
	<<if ["jammie_dodger", "rich_biscuit", "quiche"].includes($gift)>>
		Before you can hold out the <<recipe_name $gift>>, Poppy is already giving you a knowing smirk. "I could smell it from a mile away."
		<br><br>
		When you present the <<recipe_name $gift>> to <<him>>, <<he>> thanks you as <<he>> takes it from your hand.
		<br><br>
		Poppy takes a bite and groans in delight as the food hits <<his>> tastebuds. "This is delicious! How'd you know this is my favourite?"<<gglove>><<npcincr Poppy love 3>><<saveFavoriteFood "Poppy" $gift>><<if T.poppyLustUnlocked>><<glust>><<npcincr Poppy lust 2>><</if>>
		<<earnFeat "Hungry Fox">>
	<<else>>
		You hold out the <<recipe_name $gift>>. Poppy's eyes widen in surprise. <<He>> quickly recovers from the shock and takes the food from your hands with a smile.
		<br><br>
		"Oh my, this looks delicious! Did you make this yourself?" Poppy takes a bite and nods as <<he>> chews. "Yummy... thank you for sharing this with me."<<glove>><<npcincr Poppy love 1>>
	<</if>>
	<<poppyOpiumPulse>><<handheldon>>
	<<poppyLakeReturn>>
<</if>>
